  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reduce the vulnerabilities of people affected by climate change by increasing their resilience and adaptive capacity to climate change in the cercles of Mopti and Djenne. The project will contribute with improved food security, resilience, and climate adaptation for 10,000 people affected by climate change impacts, and enhanced inclusive, timely, and climate-adapted access to water, hygiene, and sanitation services for 5,000 people affected by climate related risks.</narrative>
